---
import Section from "../layout/Section.astro";
import Container from "../layout/Container.astro";
---

<Section>

  <Container>

    <header class="section-header">

      <h2>Latest News</h2>

      <p>
        Recent highlights from the NeuroTopology Group.
      </p>

    </header>

    <div class="news-list">

      <article class="news-item">

        <span class="news-date">September 2026</span>

        <div>

          <h3> New members joining NeuroTopology </h3>

          <p> We welcome one postdoctoral and two new doctoral researchers to the group.</p>

        </div>

      </article>

      <article class="news-item">

        <span class="news-date">2026</span>

        <div>

          <h3>Lida Kanari appointed Associate Editor of Brain Informatics</h3>

          <p>Joining the editorial board of the Springer Nature journal Brain Informatics.</p>

        </div>

      </article>

      <article class="news-item">

        <span class="news-date">2026</span>

        <div>

          <h3>Lida Kanari joins the Young Academy of Europe</h3>

          <p>Joining a European network of outstanding early-career researchers across disciplines.</p>

        </div>

      </article>

      <article class="news-item">

        <span class="news-date">2025</span>

        <div>

          <h3>New publication in Nature Communications </h3>

          <p>Generating brain-wide connectomes using synthetic axonal morphologies.</p>

        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </Container>

</Section>